556
00:35:21,659 --> 00:35:22,602
Scott: But we're talking about water.

557
00:35:22,622 --> 00:35:22,662
Scott: H2O.

558
00:35:25,872 --> 00:35:27,390
Rym: Don't dip your Wonder Bread in water.

559
00:35:27,850 --> 00:35:34,870
Scott: When you make bread, the ingredients of bread are flour, water, salt, yeast, but then when you bake it, the water leaves the bread and that's what makes bread.

560
00:35:34,990 --> 00:35:39,610
Scott: If the water stayed in the bread or you added the water back to the bread before eating it, that would be a problem.

561
00:35:41,551 --> 00:35:43,395
