562
00:35:43,435 --> 00:35:46,281
Scott: How can we have a moist, watery bread?

563
00:35:46,561 --> 00:35:50,870
Scott: We'll just make the bread so dense that it can handle the water, right?

564
00:35:51,411 --> 00:35:52,353
