570
00:36:17,210 --> 00:36:21,594
Rym: The history of noodles is actually super ancient and fascinating.

571
00:36:21,915 --> 00:36:36,610
Rym: Cultures all around the world have independently developed noodles and various noodle technologies that you may have heard of arose in places you would not expect and got to places that you might associate with them.

572
00:36:37,090 --> 00:36:38,513
Rym: Far later than you might think.

573
00:36:38,894 --> 00:36:45,630
Rym: Like, the term spaghetti didn't exist until 1888 and how spaghetti got to Italy is fucking fascinating.

574
00:36:49,251 --> 00:36:50,572
Rym: So let's talk about various noodles.

575
00:36:50,593 --> 00:36:51,434
Rym: Let's start with the basics.

576
00:36:51,494 --> 00:36:53,737
